    "OpenNOW" : {

    },
    "OpenNOW hides the on-screen controller while a physical controller is connected. You can keep it hidden or show both for this stream." : {

    },
    "OpenNOW iOS" : {

    },
    "OpenNOW is a client for a GeForce NOW account you provide. OpenNOW does not sell personal information, serve its own advertising, or run usage analytics." : {

    },
    "OpenNOW is built by a couple of people in their spare time. Anonymous usage numbers tell us which settings actually get used, so we know what to fix first." : {

    },
    "OpenNOW Repository" : {

    },
    "OpenNOW will attach a redacted debugging file with recent app, API, queue, and stream logs. Account credentials, email addresses, device IDs, session IDs, and network addresses are removed." : {

    },
    "OpenNOW will select all text in the focused game field and delete it." : {

    },
